   ╭─[valid_v_model.tsx:1:27]
 1 │ <template><input v-model="foo?.bar.baz"></template>
   ·                           ────────────
   ╰────
  help: `v-model` needs a plain assignable target; remove the `?.`.

  ⚠ vue(valid-v-model): Optional chaining cannot appear in 'v-model' directives.
